          "claim": "At every grid node [F4] turns this into $p(x_j)^2=\\frac32+2\\cos(x_j)+\\frac12\\cos(2x_j)$. The right side belongs to [F1]'s interpolation space.",
          "step": "2.1",
          "inputs": [
            "given",
