          "id": "four-point-quadratic-alias-check",
          "claim": "The quadratic product on the N=4 grid has interpolant 3/2+2cos(x)+(1/2)cos(2x).",
          "result": "At xj=j*pi/2, p has samples (2,-1,0,-1), so p^2=(4,1,0,1); the displayed interpolant has exactly those samples."
